body:
you also need to set `hierarchicalFacets` on the initialisation:

```js
var search = instantsearch({
  //	...
  searchParameters: {
    hierarchicalFacets: [
      {
        name: "music_hierarchical.genre.lvl0",
        attributes: [
          "music_hierarchical.genre.lvl0",
          "music_hierarchical.genre.lvl1",
          "music_hierarchical.genre.lvl2"
        ],
        separator: " > "
      }
    ],
    hierarchicalFacetsRefinements: {
      "music_hierarchical.genre.lvl0": ["Rock"]
    },
    facetingAfterDistinct: true,
    highlightPreTag: "__ais-highlight__",
    highlightPostTag: "__/ais-highlight__"
  }
});
```

Note also that the key of the refinement should be the same as the first level.

I've made a demo of that here: https://codesandbox.io/s/magical-wave-ptgqo
